      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "菱钻奇宝同学，比赛辛苦了。\r\n这场比赛让我受益匪浅。",
      "source_fingerprint": "540e88c4584cff97653601041d043b5a5369a4124673a6d565f6d566822bb817",
