      "source_text": "啊～原来是察觉到罗布罗伊的气息出现却只看见\r\n了我吗？哎呀，那真巧呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae65aa32634f721a65d56406454167e7569304b93d6cfebb178f97f1ec2273b8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
